# Portfolio stack

- Package manager: **pnpm** only
- Framework: Next.js App Router + TypeScript
- Styling: Tailwind CSS v4 tokens in `src/app/globals.css`, CSS Modules per section in `src/components/portfolio/`; spec in `THEME.md`
- Theming: `data-theme` on `<html>` set by an inline script from `localStorage` key `theme` (dark default); no theme library
- Content: `src/data/portfolio.ts` only
- Prefer matching existing patterns in `src/components/portfolio/` and `src/app/` over introducing new abstractions
- Before changing Next.js APIs, read the installed docs under `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`
